{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55642","headline":"永明山居诗（六十九首） 四十 · 延寿","name":"永明山居诗（六十九首） 四十","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"遁迹无图匿姓名，万重山後葺茅亭。\n随情因事搜新偈，探妙穷微阅古经。\n与道交时心绝念。\n从缘感处物通灵。\n应须长远存高节。\n屹屹乔松老更青。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"延寿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55642.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55642","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}